  "contract": [
    "Qualified exact Classes own readonly counted UTF-8 snapshots; constructor stores copy bytes, including NUL, into independent backing; empty snapshots allocate no string backing.",
    "Finite pure getter properties are independently checked source-bound field projections with owner-constrained borrowing. Class identity remains pointer identity.",
    "Real Bag<Class> reserve/append/take/replace/retirement preserve source evaluation, ownership, guards and descriptor layout.",
    "Explicit qualified Class release has a separate Core kind and source/cleanup checks, then uses existing CFG/SSA/LLVM cleanup operations.",
    "No source class or filename is special-cased; Note, Pair, Decorated and the original byte-exact Utf8Message declaration are exercised."
  ],
